:: title ::
## One IR, many renderers

:: image ::
![Pipeline diagram](./assets/pipeline.svg){#hero}

:: body ::
The compiled **deck.ir.json** is the durable asset.

Web and PDF are just *consumers* of it — so they can never drift apart.

